Looks like it's time for you to begin learning about [[secondary profession]]s. Why don't you head back to the encampment near Chahbek Village and speak to a few of the experts there. They can tell you all about life in the professions.

==Quest information==
===Requirements===
{{Standard prerequisites
 |campaign = Nightfall
}}

===Objectives===
*Travel to the [[Sunspear encampment]] near [[Chahbek Village (outpost)|Chahbek Village]].
*Speak to at least one non-[primary profession] expert.
*See First Spear Devhad for your reward.

===Reward===
* 500 [[Experience]]
* 200 [[Gold]]
* 5 [[Sunspear Promotion Point]]s
* [[Battle Commendation]]

====Skills====
The following skills can be learned by a character and [[unlock]]ed for the account by talking to each of the experts for the possible secondary professions. Accepting skills from the trainer for a different profession or accepting a different secondary profession during the next quest will unlearn these skills, but will leave them unlocked for the account:
